    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VR ESCAPE ROOM WHERE EVERYTHING FEELS REAL </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Explore an authentic voxel reconstruction of 221B Baker Street as if you were really there. No complicated menus, no artificial interfaces\u2014just you, your intuition, and a fully interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.poster.avif?t=1741101472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.webm?t=1741101472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.mp4?t=1741101472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>\ud83d\udd0e <strong>A Mystery to Uncover</strong> \u2013 Sherlock Holmes has disappeared, and the key to the mystery lies hidden in his own room. <strong>Search for clues, experiment, and solve puzzles at your own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd7d <strong>Natural Movement, No Barriers</strong> \u2013 Walk freely, crouch to examine details, or reach out to grab objects. No buttons to memorize\u2014<strong>everything feels just like real life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f <strong>Interact with Everything Around You</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world full of details:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Play</strong> Sherlock Holmes\u2019 violin \ud83c\udfbb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Experiment</strong> with chemical mixtures \ud83e\uddea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Enjoy</strong> the books in his library and uncover hidden secrets \ud83d\udcda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles Designed for Exploration and Discovery</strong> \u2013 Observe, experiment, and <strong>find the logic behind every puzzle</strong> hidden in the room of the world\u2019s most famous detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>A Short Yet Immersive Experience</strong> \u2013 Designed to be enjoyed in a single session, perfect for those looking for a <strong>VR escape room without long play sessions</strong>.</p>",
